<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli haasonehe muhanda huli Bamukristo ba hu Efeso, peleve mu mabundu ma Asiya ya hu baanda, na ma hu tsi ya Turikiya ya lolo yiniiyi. Muhanda mo wunuuwu, wu nde haasonehe mu kondaayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">3.1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:1">4.1</ref></char>), li mu ukuukaha na utsudasa mandongisili ma tsyelele ma Pahuli huli mabundu mo maana. Nde asonehe nde huli Bamukristo ba baavele Bayudaayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngu musamu wu muhanda huli bisu Efeso wu afulala tsoongo, ni wu lisuunda la Nzambi. Lo ni tswehi yi yibeedi kini yaasweme, li Yisu amiiyabisa ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. Lisuunda la Nzambi liniili, lili umata beleve. Lo limiivangama mu lituma la Yisu Kristo. Lisuunda mo ni pangili a byosi: mayulu na toto. Lo lili mu utuunga itwadi hya baatu ŋa hati la bo, na itwadi ŋa hati la baatu na Nzambi. Mutso lisuunda mo liina, libundu lili na mbuha yinene. Ŋa musonihi a muhanda ali mu uyambila mu libundu, hu li imbuli hi bali mu umono mu mabundu mo maana. Musonihi a muhanda li mu uyambila mu lo mu mapfwanisini ma malahi. Libundu lili we nyutu a Kristo, yi yibaaveletsikama ukula. Lo lili we nzo yi bali mu utuunga mu Kristo. Bamukristo bali mu uhwaada mu utuunga lo. Lo laapfuutana na Kristo, bumosi we bu mukadi haapfuutana na mulumi a nde.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mu mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1">1</ref></char> natee <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 3">3</ref></char>, musonihi li mu usiitasa mu itwadi hi bamiituunga, mu tooni ati, Yisu ayehuli muvumu a nde ŋa kuruwa. Bamukristo ba baavele Bayudaayo, bamiituunga buli limosi na Bamukristo ba bali Bayudaayo. Bo bali mu uyaka mabwe ni mo mamosi huli Nzambi. <char style="em">Kristo amiitsala ibaha hi ibelili </char> na amiinongese ba baabeedi baamiitahuha. Ni mu buuna, nde amiibehe hyenze huli boosi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4">4</ref></char> natee <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6">6</ref></char>, musonihi li mu uvondo Bamukristo mu ukaanga imiinu hya bo, mu uba itwadi na umweese hyenze bi Nzambi haamiiva bo. Bali mu uhwadisa bo mu <char style="em">udyata mu ndyatili yi nyatihi.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Musonihi a muhanda li mu uva mandoongi, mu itwadi hya hutso ibaandu (buli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:21">5.21</ref></char> natee buli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">6.9</ref></char>). Dyambu la ngu aba ni ti, bakadi baafwana usiingala balumi ba bo. Balumi aba ni bapfumu. Musonihi a muhanda, li mu uyambila fula-fula huli balumi. Tso bo bali bapfumu, bo baafwana uba we Kristo, wu ayehuli muvumu a nde.</para>
  <para style="io1">Lo lili dyambu li linyatihi mu uleele huli balumi, mu utondo bakadi ba bo (buli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">5.25</ref></char> natee <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:33">5.33</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">Bumosi kaka, lo lili dyambu li linyatihi huli bakuutu, mu uyaaba ti bo bali na Pfumu hu mayulu (buli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">6.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Ni me Pahuli, wu li iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo, mu litondo la Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Me ndi mu utsonehe huli bisu musyenge a Efeso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Efeso </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabuuku makima a mali na ikuma hya Efeso ve. Mu miyilala mya Pahuli hu Efeso, utala kaka mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Mav 18.19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1-40">19.1-40</ref></char>.</note>, ba bali ba buli la Nzambi, ba ngetetee na ba bali itwadi na Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu, na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze!<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwe ma Nzambi haava bisu mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Liyuusaani Nzambi, Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo! Nde asyemi bisu bu nde haava lisyeme loosi li livupu la hu mbuha a hu mayulu, mu itwadi hya bisu na Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Tswamina pangili a tsi, Nzambi aba amiikwasoolo bisu mana bisu liba bangidi hwavele ipiha ŋa busu bwa nde. Mu litondo la nde, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Nzambi amiitswamina uvolo kesili ti, nde ukitusa bisu baana ba nde mu nzila ya Yisu Kristo. Maana ni ma nde haatondi mu bubwe bwa nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Bunuubu, livaani Nzambi muyusu, mu bungodu bu bubwe, bu nde haaviidi bisu na bunyanga bwosi, mu Mwana a nde wa bahala wu litondo.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Eye, makila ma Kristo maamiiyobolo bisu mu bubi, na Nzambi amiinyahula masumu ma bisu. Ni mu buuna, nde haamiimweese bisu busina bwa hyese hya nde, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />hi nde haava bisu bu hwaafulala, na tsiki na nzaabili yoosi. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Mu bubwe bwa nde, Nzambi ayabisi bisu lisuunda la nde la tswehi, li nde haatswamini uvangimasa mu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Lisuunda mo li Nzambi huukuhasa hu tsukusu a taangu, ni li ukuukaha byosi bi bili hu mayulu, na bi bili ŋa toto, hu tsina mutumi ndulu mumosi, ni Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mu itwadi hya bisu na Kristo, bisu kaka laamiiyaka la bisu kabu li mukobe, li Nzambi haasiidi bisu lahi. Bisu ba nde haateehili usoolo, we bu hwaba lisuunda la nde wuuna, wu ubaavangimasa moosi, we bu hu li kesili na litondo la nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Nyaha livaani nde muyusu, bisu ba laabeedi batsomi mu usa hiitu mu Kristo!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Benu kaka, ŋa benu laayuhi tsaangu yi imbuli, na Musamu wu Mubwe wu abehili benu liyobolo, benu laasiidi imiinu mu Kristo. Buuna Nzambi akumi iliimbu hya nde mwakulu mu benu, iliimbu hi Livupu la Ngidi hi nde haasiidi lahi. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Livupu la Ngidi lili we kabu latsomi, mu bisiha bi nde haamiisa bisu lahi. Lo lili mu uva bisu hiitu ti bisu luubaha mukobe mo wuuna, ŋa liyobolo la bisu luuvangama. Buuna, liyuusaani bunene bwa Nzambi!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu la Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ni mu buuna, bu me anzuha tsaangu imiinu hya benu mu Pfumu Yisu, na litondo la benu mu banga imiinu boosi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />me a haakolo mu ufutala matondo huli Nzambi mu tooni a benu ve. Me umbaatsima mu benu mu masambulu ma me, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />na me ndi mu upondo huli Nzambi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, Taata nga muyusu, mu uva benu Livupu la tsiki, li luukaabangula na ubaayabisa benu nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nyaha nde ayalusa miisu mi mutima a benu, mana benu litsikaha, ki hiitu hyaakangama mu teelili yi nde haateeli benu, na ki busina bu muyusu a mabwe, ma nde haamiiswehele ba buli la nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Nyaha nde ayabisa benu, ki bunene bu matwala ma kimuhili, ma nde ali na mo mu bisu banga imiinu. Matwala mo maana, ni ma Nzambi haasalili na ibahala, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ŋa nde haasuuli Kristo ŋa hati la babaakwa, na haatsahisi nde ŋa mbahala a nde hu mbuha a hu mayulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Nzambi amiibyalisa Kristo ŋa yulu a pasi lituma, pasi matwala, pasi mifudi, pasi ipfumu na pasi nduhi kima yi buutwala utata, ndulu a ŋa tsi mo yiniiyi ve, ka naapa mu tsi yi yiuya. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nzambi amiisuusa bisiha byosi hu tsina a miilu mya Kristo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:7">Mkg 8.7</ref></char></note>, na amiisuusa nde mu uba mutumi a libundu. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Libundu ni nyutu a Kristo, ni mu lo, Kristo ali mu umonehele nde woosi, nde wu li mu uluusa bisiha byosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:19">Kol 1.19</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Umata mu lipfu mu uvyoho hu moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Hutsomi, benu laabeedi we ba baamiikwa mu tooni a ma mabi ma benu, na mu masumu ma benu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Benu laabeedi na mbiili a baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Benu laakasiingala mutumi a matwala ma mabi, ma maaba ŋa hati la yulu na toto. Ni livupu li lili mu usalila mu ba bubaatuna Nzambi lolo yiniiyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Hutsomi, bisu kaka laabeedi boosi mu kabu la baatu mo baana, ŋa bisu laakadyata we bu hu li manzala na matsimi ma bisu ma mabi. Mu tooni imuutu hya bisu, bisu baatu laahwama na kesi a Nzambi we baatu bakima boosi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ka Nzambi aluula mu kwili lingebe! Bunene bu litondo la nde mu bisu ni ti, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />bu bisu laabeedi babaakwa mu tooni a ma mabi ma bisu, Nzambi abweva bisu moonyi mu Kristo. Ni mu hyese hya Nzambi benu laayobihi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Mu itwadi hya bisu na Yisu Kristo, Nzambi asuuli bisu mu babaakwa, na atsahisi bisu itwadi na nde hu mbuha ya hu mayulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Mu bubwe bu nde haamweesi bisu mu Yisu Kristo, nde atondi umweese mu tsi yi yiuya, busina bwa kimuhili bwa hyese hya nde. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ni mu hyese hya Nzambi benu laayobihi mu tooni imiinu hya benu. Liyobolo mo liina a lili mu umata huli benu ve, lo ni bungodu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Liyobolo mo liina, a lili kaluha a mavaanga ma benu ve. Na buuna, muutu utwala ubula mabyoho ve. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Mu mbuli, bisu mavaanga ma Nzambi. Nde avaangi bisu mu itwadi na Yisu Kristo, mu ukuhasa mavaanga ma mabwe, ma Nzambi haaba haamiitswamina uvangimasa, mana bisu lisalila mo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buli limosi mu Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Yibuhalaani moonyi baana benu laaba hutsomi! Benu a lili Bayudaayo mu ubuta ve. Ni mu buuna, Bayudaayo bali mu uleele benu ti benu ba «baavelekete». Ka uto ti bo, bali mu uteele bo ba «baakete» mu tooni iliimbu hya ketili hi baasa mu nyutu a bo. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Eye, mu taangu mo yiina, benu laabeedi ba baaveleyaaba Kristo. Benu laabeedi byenyi, benu a laabeedi ba ibaandu hya Nzambi ve. Benu a laabeedi hutso manzuhisini ma Nzambi haasiidi malahi ve. Benu laakaba mu tsi hwavele hiitu, hwavele uyaaba Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ka bunuubu, mu itwadi hya na Yisu Kristo, benu ba laabeedi lala, baayasusala benu bebele na Kristo, mu tooni bungodu bu makila ma nde.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Eye, Kristo ni hyenze hya bisu, nde wu asa ti Bayudaayo na bangoyi baba buli limosi. Mu nzyehulili a nyutu a nde ŋa kuruwa, nde abwiisi ibaha hi hyakakaba bo na hi hyakasa bo iboho. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kristo atsambimisi mikele mi Bayudaayo na matumili, na makesili ma myo, mu utuunga ŋa hati li Bayudaayo na bangoyi, buli limosi li linyatihi mu itwadi hya na nde. Buuna ni bu nde haatuungi hyenze. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Mu lipfu la nde ŋa kuruwa, Kristo apfuuti bo boosi mu nyutu mosi, na anongisi bo na Nzambi. Mu kuruwa a nde, nde atsali iboho hya bo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Buuna, Kristo ayidi mu uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wa hyenze, huli benu ba laabeedi lala na Nzambi, na huli ba baabeedi bebele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Esa 57.19</ref></char></note> na Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Mbuli, ni mu Kristo bisu boosi, Bayudaayo na bangoyi, luutwala mu uyene ŋa busu bwa Nzambi Taata, mu likumbasa li Livupu la Ngidi ndulu limosi.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Buuna, benu bangoyi, benu a lisaali byenyi na bapyohi-nzila ve. Ka bunuubu benu lika muutu mumosi na bangidi, binama bya buli la Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Baamiituunga benu mu tuungili yi biluumbi na mimbihuli bali bibeene, yi Yisu Kristo nde mwakulu ali manya li ituungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Nde ni wu li mu uva mifudi mya nzo yoosi, na wu li mu utelemese yo na uvangimasa yo nzo a ngidi ya Pfumu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu itwadi hya na Kristo, benu kaka limiikoto mu tuungili a nzo, mu uba itwadi na bana boosi, nzo yi Nzambi ali mu utsahala mu Livupu la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:4-5">1Pe 2.4-5</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isalu hya Pahuli huli bangoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ni mu buuna, me Pahuli, me ndi ikondaayi hya Yisu Kristo, mu uyabisa benu ba lili bangoyi musamu a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Mav 9.15</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Me tsimi ti benu laayuhi isalu hi Nzambi haaviidi me mu hyese hya nde, mu tooni a benu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ni mu imono-miisu, Nzambi haamweesi me lisuunda la nde la tswehi. Me miitsonehe mo mu mikuma mya hoole. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Bu benu luutaanga mo, benu luutsikaha nzaabili yi me ndi na yo mu tswehi a Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Hutsomi, Nzambi a haayabisi tswehi mo yiina huli baatu ve. Ka bunuubu, nde li mu umweese yo mu nzila Livupu la nde, huli biluumbi bya nde bya ngidi na huli mimbihuli. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Tswehi mo ni yiniiyi: mu nzila a Musamu wu Mubwe, bangoyi na Bayudaayo buubyalila mukobe ni nde mumosi. Bo bali binama bya nyutu mosi, na buuyaka lahi ndulu ni lo limosi li Nzambi haamiisiila bo mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Me aka mulongisi a Musamu wu Mubwe, mu tooni bungodu bu Nzambi haamiiva me, mu bubwe bwa nde, na mu matwala ma nde. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Huli me, wu afulala bukenyi ŋa hati la bangidi boosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:9">1Ko 15.9</ref></char></note>, Nzambi aviidi me hyese hi uyabisa huli bangoyi, busina bwa Kristo bu buuveletwala uyelemese. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Me ambaha hyese hi uyalusa baatu boosi, buni Nzambi huuvangimasa lisuunda la nde la tswehi. Nde ni muvaangi a bisiha byosi. Nde aswehe lisuunda mo liina umata beleve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25-26">Lom 16.25-26</ref></char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />mana mu taangu mo yiniiyi, mu likumbasa li libundu, banga lituma na banga matwala ba hu mbuha ya hu mayulu, bayaaba tsiki a Nzambi ya pila mu pila. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Maana moosi maayelemene na lisuunda la Nzambi li bilima na bilima, li nde haatswihasa mu nzila a Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mu itwadi hya na Kristo, na mu imiinu hya bisu mu nde, bisu lili na bunyanga bu uyaasusaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na hiitu hi hyakuha. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Buuna, me ndi mu upondo huli benu, mu uvelekolese binama, mu munyongi wu me ndi mu umono mu tooni a benu. Munyongi mo wuuna, ni wu ubwese benu kaluha yi muyusu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Litondo la Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu utsokomo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi Taata. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Pasi ibaandu, umata hu yulu natee ŋa toto, hyabaha nduhi a hyo mu nde. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Me ndi mu upondo nde, we bu hu li busina bu muyusu a nde, mana mivumu mya benu mihwada mu matwala ma Livupu la nde. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Me ndi mu upondo kaka ti Kristo aba hutso mitima mya benu mu imiinu, na ti benu limene manganzi na benu lituunga litondo li laavaanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Buuna, benu sa litwala ubaangula na bangidi boosi, buni litondo la Kristo lili na taha, bula, idoongi na mutaabu. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Mu mbuli, benu luuyaaba litondo la Kristo, tso bu lo laalutahala pasi nzaabili, mana benu liba ba baaluula mu muvumu woosi, na mu matwala, bi bibaamata huli Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Huli Nzambi wu ubaasala mu bisu, mu matwala ma uvaanga bi byafulala bi bisu libaavondo nde, na ma maavyoho ma bisu libaatsima. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Nyaha muyusu aba wa nde, mu libundu mu nzila a Yisu Kristo, mu matuungi moosi, na mu bilima na bilima. Ameni!<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bumosi mu nyutu a Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Me wu ndi ikondaayi mu tooni a Pfumu, me ndi mu upondo benu mu udyata mu mbiili yi yaayelemene na teelili yi benu laayaki, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />na kulimini, na bulembo, na mukami. Baakumbasanaani mu litondo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Baahwadaani mu ukeelese itwadi hi Livupu la Ngidi libaava, mu hyenze hi hibaapfuuta benu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Hu li na nyutu ndulu mosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Lom 12.5</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:12">1Ko 12.12</ref> </char></note>, na Livupu ndulu limosi. Bumosi kaka, bu Nzambi haateeli benu, nde asooli benu mu hiitu ndulu imosi, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />na Pfumu ndulu mumosi, mu imiinu imosi na mu tondihili mosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Hu li na Nzambi ndulu mosi, ni Taata a boosi, wu ubaatuma boosi, wu ubaasala mu boosi na wu ubaakwilala mu boosi.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ka pasi muutu mu bisu a benu, ayaka hyese we bu hu li iteesi hi bungodu bu Kristo haava. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ni buuna, baaleele mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«Bu nde haakumisi hu hati mayulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nde abiti bikondaayi ŋa mbisa a nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nde aviidi bungodu huli baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:19">Mkg 68.19</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Ka hima hitondi uleele: «Nde akumisi»? Hyo hitondi uleele ti Kristo akulimini kaka natee hu tsina a toto. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Wu akulimini, ni nde wuuna kaka wu akumisi hu hati mayulu, mana nde aluusa bisiha byosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Nde amiibyalisa bamosi we biluumbi, bakima we mimbihuli, bakima we milongisi mi Musamu wu Mubwe, na bakima we basalili ba libundu, na bayihisi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:28">1Ko 12.28</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ni buuna, nde haavangimisi bangidi mu usa isalu hya bo mu uhwadisa nyutu a Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />natee bu bisu boosi luuba laakangama itwadi mu imiinu na mu nzaabili a Mwana a Nzambi. Buuna, bisu luuba ba tuungi la ba baakula, natee bu luuto mu iteesi hya nyutu yi yaasupaha ya Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Bisu a luubweba bangebe ve, ba baatu bali mu ubita mu mapo, buuve mu bidyengese bi mandongisili ma pila mu pila, ma baatu banga a soho bubaapfuta, mu ubwisa bakima hutso a myeto. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ka tso lileeli imbuli mu litondo, bisu sa likula mu moosi natee bu luuto bebele na Kristo, wu li mutswe libundu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ni mu tooni a nde, nyutu yili yaasunda, yi yaakangama mu makede ma yo moosi. Buuna, ŋa pasi inama hibaasala we bu hyo hyafwana, na nyutu yoosi yibaakula na ubama mu litondo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moonyi wu munyatihi mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Buuna, monwaani mambu ma me undeele benu, ma me utsinzandeele mu nduhi a Pfumu: a laabwedyata we bangoyi. Matsimi ma bo a mali na lisuunga ve. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Matsimi ma bo mu baafuha bo mutso a piipidi. Bo baamiitahuha na moonyi wu li mu umata huli Nzambi. Mu tooni ati, bo bitsuudu bi binene na bo bali na mitima mi minono. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Bo abaasaalamono tsonyi ve. Bo a buutwala usa lisobosono ŋa hati li mabwe na mabi ve, ka bo bali mu usa mayamba ma pila mu pila na lehemene la mbongo.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ka benu, Kristo a haalongese benu mbiili mo yiina ve! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Benu laayuha moosi ma baatoyo mu Yisu? Benu laayuha ma baalongese mu nde? Eye, ma benu laayuha mu nde, ni imbuli. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Buuna, siisaani mbiili a benu yi kulu, tiimbaani imuutu hya benu hi ikulu, hi manzala ma hyo mu baabita benu hu bipfu bya soho. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Benu laafwana ukituha baatu ba banyatihi, mu Livupu li lili mu usala mu matsimi ma benu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Lwataani imuutu hi inyatihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">imuutu hi inyatihi </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:17">2Ko 5.17</ref></char></note>, hibaavaanga mu ifwafwani hya Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">ifwafwani hya Nzambi </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Mba 1.26-27</ref> </char></note> mu butsiitsa na bungidi bwosi, hi hili mu ubuta imbuli.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ni mu buuna, timbaani mapfuta! Nyaha pasi muutu abaaleele imbuli huli munande<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zak 8.16</ref> </char></note>, mu tooni ati, bisu boosi lili binama bya nyutu ndulu mosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Tso benu libahi kesi, a lisumaha ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:5">Mkg 4.5</ref> </char></note>. Ka nyaha kesi a benu yivudamana teehele nyangu adyama. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />A liva Saatana nzila yi unangimana benu ve. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Nyaha muyibi abweveleyiba, ka nde afwana umono pasi mu usala mu myoho mya nde mwakulu, mu abaha bi nde huukumbasa ba baakeehele. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Nyaha dyambu tso limosi lilibi livelepala mu minywa mya benu. Ka, baaleelaani mambu ma mabwe, ma muutuunga hyenze huli ba bali mu uyuha benu. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />A linyongese Livupu la Ngidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Esa 63.10</ref></char></note> la Nzambi ve. Lo ni iliimbu hi baakuma benu, mu tooni ilumbu hi liyobolo. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Bingaani matsimi moosi ma kali, ma bunyama, ma kesi, ma mibabu na bituhi. Kukaani nyutu mu mbiili yi bukanyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Baani baatu ba babwe na ba baaluula mu litondo la bana mu bana. Baasaani bana kolo-kolo, we bu Nzambi ubaasa benu kolo-kolo mu nzila a Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Udyata hutso liyalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Bu benu lili baana ba Nzambi haatondo, volwaani ifwaani hya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19.2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mty 5.48</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Nyaha ndyatili a benu yiba hu tsina litondo, mu ifwaani hya Kristo. Nde atondi bisu, ni mu buuna, nde haayehuli muvumu a nde huli Nzambi mu tooni a bisu. Lipfu la nde laaba we kabu na bungodu bwa tsuhili, bi tsulu yili yimbwe we nyafi ŋa busu bwa Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Pal 29.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yow 3.16</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Nyaha bumbembo, tsumihili ya pila mu pila, buuve nyungu, a byafwana umonehele tso ŋa hati la benu ve, we bu hwafwana huli baatu bangidi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />A hwafwana kaka ve ti, benu libaapalisa mikuma mya tsonyi, mi myavyasahana buuve mya mbiindu. Ka baasaani masambulu ma pfutili matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ka yaabaani lo bubwe: a hu li na muutu tso mumosi wu ukoto hu Ipfumu hya Kristo na hya Nzambi ve, mu ba bubaasalila bumbembo, tsumihili buuve nyungu, nyungu mbindulili ni ti kuundili bifwita.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Nyaha pasi muutu a hasoho benu mu bileedi bi mapfuta. Mu tooni ati, ni mu mambu mo maana kesi a Nzambi yibaabwila ba bubaatunala nde. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />A livaanga dyambu tso limosi itwadi na baatu mo baana ve. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Hutsomi, benu abeedi hutso a piipidi ya dunga-dunga. Ka bunuubu, mu itwadi hya benu na Pfumu, benu laaka hutso liyalala. Buuna, dyataani we baatu ba bali mu liyalala. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Mu tooni ati, liyalala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22">Ngl 5.22</ref></char></note> libaabuta ma mabwe ma pila mu pila, butsiitsa na imbuli. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Hwadaani mu utsikaha mambu ma mu baamweese Pfumu kinya. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />A liba itwadi na mavaanga ma maavele na tsoongo ve, ma bubaasalila hutso a piipidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Lom 13.12</ref> </char></note>, ka tungalalaani mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ni tsonyi mu utoyele mu mambu ma baatu bakima bali mu uvaanga mu tswehi. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kaahu, moosi ma bamiiyandiha ŋa liyalala, mu baayaluha. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Mu tooni ati, pasi hi bubaayandiha ŋa liyalala, hibaayaluha. Ni mu buuna, bubaaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Suuha, we wu li mu ubwamina tolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">suuha ŋa hati la babaakwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">na Kristo uyalusa we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:1-3">Esa 60.1-3</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ni mu buuna, baakelaani na bukuhu mu ndyatili a benu: a we baatu banga maladi ve, ka we baatu banga tsiki. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Salilaani tangu bu hwafwana, mu tooni ati, bilumbu mo biniibi bili bi bibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ni mu buuna, a liba biyahudi ve, ka baahwadaani mu ubaangula ki mambu Pfumu haatondo.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />A likolo malamu ve. Kolili malamu yi yibaabita benu hu budyabidi. Ka luulaani mu Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Baahwadasanaani mu mikuunga na nyimbu, na nyimbu Livupu. Yimbaani mikuunga na nyimbu mu uyuusa Pfumu mu mitima mya benu woosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:1-3">Mkg 33.1-3</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Baafutalaani matondo huli Nzambi Taata mu taangu yoosi, na mu moosi mu nduhi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakadi na balumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Siingaani uba hu tsina lituma la bana mu bana, mu tooni likiinzu li benu lili na lo mu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Bakadi, siingaani uba hu tsina lituma li balumi ba benu, we bu benu libaasiinga uba hu tsina lituma la Pfumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mu tooni ati, mulumi ni mutswe a mukadi, we bu Kristo ali mutswe a libundu li lili nyutu a nde, na li nde ali Muyobili a lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />We bu libundu libaasiinga uba hu tsina lituma la Kristo mu mambu moosi, ni buuna kaka bakadi baafwana usiinga uba hu tsina lituma li balumi ba bo, mu mambu moosi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Balumi, tondwaani bakadi ba benu, we bu Kristo haatondi libundu na haayehuli moonyi a nde mu tooni a lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Kristo atondi ubyalisa baatu ba libundu la nde huli Nzambi, hu mbisa utsyemese lo mu mamba na mu Musamu a nde. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Nde atondi umweese libundu huli Nzambi hutso muyusu a lo loosi, li laavele na toodi, tso munyuda, tso masyembo makima, ka libundu la ngidi na li laavele na ipiha. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Bumosi kaka, balumi baafwana utondo bakadi ba bo we nyutu a bo mwakulu. Woosi wu ubaatondo mukadi a nde, ubaatondo nde mwakulu. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Eye, a hu li na muutu tso mumosi wu abelele nyutu a nde mwakulu ve. Ka muutu ubaabuungala nyutu a nde na ubaakele yo, we bu Kristo ubaasa mu libundu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />li lili nyutu a nde yi bisu boosi lili binama.<verse eid="EPH 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />We bu baasonehe: «Ni mu buuna, bahala luusiisa taata a nde na ngu a nde mu ukangama na mukadi a nde, na bo baboole buukituha nyutu mosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mba 2.24</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Hu li ŋaniiŋa na imbuli hi hyasweme: me ndi mu undeele mu tswehi yi yitali Kristo na libundu. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ka yo yaahwama kaka na benu: hwafwana ti pasi mulumi abaatondo mukadi a nde we nde mwakulu, na pasi mukadi abaakiinza mulumi a nde.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baana na babuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Baana, bu benu laakangama mu Pfumu, siingalaani babuti ba benu mu tooni ati, buuna ni bu hwafwana. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />«Kiinza taata a we na ngu a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pal 20.12</ref></char></note>» wuuna ni mukele watsomi wu li na lahi. Lahi mo lili mu uleele bunuubu: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />«Mana we ba mu kinya, na ti idiingu hya we hiba hi ila ŋa toto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pal 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Pfu 5.16</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Benu babuti, a liva baana ba benu kesi mu tooni a mbiili a benu ve, ka baakulasaani bo mu ubaava mandoongi na tsungili yi Pfumu ubaatondo.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baviha na bapfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Benu baviha, baasiingalaani bapfumu ba benu ba ŋa toto na kulimini, na likiinzu, na mutima wu ayuluha we benu balili mu usalila Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />A lisa buuna ndulu ŋa busu bwa bo mu umweese bo kinya ve, ka baasanaani isalu hya bo mu mutima a benu woosi, mu ukuhasa litondo la Nzambi we baviha ba Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Baasalilaani bo na kinya yoosi, mu tooni ati, benu Pfumu lili mu usalila, ka a baatu ve. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Yibuhalaani moonyi ti pasi muutu, tso nde li muviha buuve bunyanga, tso vaangi ma mabwe, Pfumu usyende nde.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Benu bapfumu, saani bumosi kaka mu baviha ba benu. A laabakanina usa bo bubi. Yibuhalaani moonyi ti, Pfumu a bo na wa benu ni nde mumosi wu li hu mayulu, nde wu avele na buraandu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Pfu 10.17</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilwanili bya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Mu umana, hwadisaani mivumu mya benu mu Pfumu, na mu matwala ma nde moosi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Lwataani bilwanili byosi bya Nzambi, mana benu likalila nyutu ŋa busu bwa soho la Saatana. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Mu tooni ati, mudiingu a bisu a mu ulwanisa musunya na makila ve. Ka bisu lili mu ulwanisa matwala, batumi na bipfumu bya tsi ya piipidi ya dunga-dunga, matwala ma mavupu ma mabi ma mali hu mayulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ni mu buuna, lwataani bilwanili byosi bya Nzambi, mana benu likalila nyutu mu ilumbu hya tsisu, hu mbisa ulwana natee hu tsukusu, benu luubwehwada uba mu tele.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ni mu buuna, baavangamaani: hadaani imbuli we mudi a mu luungu. Lwataani butsiitsa we ikutu hi mudiingu. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Lwataani bikoodi bya benu, ni lehemene li uyalongese Musamu wu Mubwe wa hyenze. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Mu pasi taangu, kaangaani imiinu, ni ilwanili hi ibaapfubaha linyutu. Ilwanili hi hyutwala udimasa mbaahu makongo moosi ma Nga Bubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Volwaani kaka ibudu hi mudiingu, ni liyobolo, na sabila wu Livupu la Ngidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Esa 11.5</ref></char></note>, ni Musamu a Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Baasambilaani taangu yoosi mu baatu ba Nzambi, mu masambulu ma pila mu pila na mu mapondili moosi, baasambilaani mu Livupu. Baani na mukonono mu ubaasambila mu bangidi boosi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Baasambilaani mu me kaka, mana Nzambi adibula matsimi ma me, mu upalisa mikuma mya tsiitsa ŋa me ukaanzambila, na me mbanzabisa matswehi ma liyobolo ma Musamu wu Mubwe na hiitu hyoosi. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Tso bu me ndi mutso a kondaayi, me ndi iluumbi hi Musamu wu Mubwe mo wuuna. Buuna, baasambilaani mana me mbanzabisa nde na hiitu hyoosi, we bu hwafwana.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsukusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tisiike<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Mav 20.4</ref></char></note>, mwana a ngu abisu wu litondo, wu li musalili a Pfumu wa ngetetee, sa ava benu mapolo moosi ma me, mana benu liyaaba, buni me ndi. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Me miitsindaha benu nde, mana benu liyaaba buni bisu lili na mu uhwadisa benu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata, na Pfumu Yisu Kristo bava huli baana ba ngu, hyenze na litondo napa imiinu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nyaha hyese hya Nzambi hiba na boosi ba bubaatondo Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, mu litondo li luuvesuka.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>